@startuml
title UC-04 account diagnostics — DIAG-01..14
actor "Platform Engineer / Admin" as User
boundary "Account Diagnose UI" as UI
control "Diagnostic Controller" as API
control "Diagnostic Service / Worker" as Service
entity "Report Repository" as Reports
control "Scoped Identity Resolver" as Identity
control "Probe Adapters" as Probe
User -> UI : choose account / purpose / scope
UI -> API : start(expected account version, safe scope)
API -> Service : authenticated Organization + actor
Service -> Reports : validate scope and insert QUEUED
Reports --> Service : persisted run ID
API --> UI : 202 run ID / actual state
Service -> Reports : claim bounded owner / lease
Service -> Identity : resolve saved account credential
Identity --> Service : transient scoped identity
loop applicable checks, bounded and cancellable
  Service -> Probe : inspect exact target / requirements
  Probe --> Service : safe typed observation or evidence gap
  Service -> Reports : persist finding / real completed count
end
opt explicit supported Kubernetes execution
  Service -> Reports : record unique intended probe ownership
  Service -> Probe : create run-owned namespace and probes
  Probe --> Service : observed UIDs / readiness
  Service -> Reports : save owned resource facts
  Service -> Probe : ownership + UID guarded cleanup
  Probe --> Service : verified absence or unknown cleanup
end
Service -> Reports : terminal state + safe findings / cleanup
UI -> API : poll / reload / read history
API -> Reports : Organization + account scoped query
Reports --> UI : persisted scope/time/progress/findings
opt user stop or owner interruption
  UI -> API : request cancel
  API -> Reports : CAS cancellation request
  Service -> Probe : stop and bounded cleanup
  Service -> Reports : CANCELLED / INTERRUPTED with honest cleanup
end
@enduml
